Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, policykit-1 | polkitd | pkexec
Recommends: hblock
Description: Visual switch and statistics for the hblock DNS ad-blocker
 Enable or disable hblock, trigger on-demand updates and inspect blocking
 statistics from a simple Libadwaita interface.